#### [NEW] [theme_controller.go](file:///d:/siakad/backend/controllers/theme_controller.go)

Controller dengan 4 endpoint:

| Method | Route | Akses | Deskripsi |
|--------|-------|-------|-----------|
| `GET` | `/api/public/theme` | **Publik** (tanpa auth) | Ambil tema global aktif — dipakai frontend saat load |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/theme` | Super Admin | Ambil tema untuk halaman editor admin |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/theme` | Super Admin | Update konfigurasi tema (upsert 1 record) |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/theme/reset` | Super Admin | Reset semua value ke default awal |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/theme/upload-logo` | Super Admin | Upload file logo (multipart/form-data) |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/theme/upload-favicon` | Super Admin | Upload file favicon (multipart/form-data) |

**Detail endpoint upload:**
- Menerima file gambar (PNG/JPG/SVG/ICO) via multipart form
- Menyimpan ke `d:\siakad\backend\uploads\branding\` 
- Mengembalikan URL relatif yang disimpan di field `LogoURL` / `FaviconURL`
- Validasi: max 2MB, hanya format gambar

**Detail endpoint reset:**
- Mengembalikan semua field ke nilai default hardcoded
- Tidak menghapus file logo/favicon yang sudah diupload

